A heading at an item's content column leaves no paragraph open

```
- | a |
  # h
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- | a |
  prose
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    prose
tail
  </li>
</ul>
```
